    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://fosstodon.org/@farmOS/117167722332201236</guid>
      <link>https://fosstodon.org/@farmOS/117167722332201236</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 13:32:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;We are seeing a surge in AI-generated projects calling themselves &amp;quot;FarmOS&amp;quot;. Thankfully we were proactive about registering the &lt;a href="https://fosstodon.org/tags/farmOS" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;farmOS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; trademark and establishing community guidelines for its use (&lt;a href="https://farmOS.org/community/trademark/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=""&gt;farmOS.org/community/trademark/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;). Enforcing it takes time away from more important work, though. Are other &lt;a href="https://fosstodon.org/tags/opensource" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;opensource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; projects experiencing this?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <category>farmos</category>
      <category>OpenSource</category>
    </item>
